# Written fresh for v2, not inherited. Short on purpose — this build has no
# framework yet, so anything listed here is something that actually exists on
# disk right now.

# Secrets. `.env.local` currently holds a Vercel OIDC token, so this line is
# load-bearing from the first commit rather than something to add later.
.env*
!.env.example

# Build outputs, and the two launch-week note directories that sit in this
# working copy without belonging to the repo. `nisham/` and `sumayya/` are
# dated personal plans — they exist in no commit on any branch, so treat them
# as unrecoverable rather than as leftovers to sweep up.
node_modules/
.next/
.vercel/
nisham/
sumayya/

.DS_Store
*.tsbuildinfo

# Machine-local agent settings, and Next's generated types. Neither is a
# decision this project made.
.claude/
next-env.d.ts
